courses.learning_outcomes:
By the end the course, students will be able to:
1. critically assess a particular population in need;
2. acquire and apply knowledge on program development and evaluation;
3. initiate and implement a service-learning project;
4. relate the service-learning experience with theories on altruism, pro-social behavior and volunteerism;
5. reflect in depth their personal development in relation to their service-learning experience.
